flowchart LR
    A[Accelerometer\nGyroscope\nMagnetometer] --> B[Motion + heading model]
    C[GPS fix + speed] --> D[DR correction]
    E[Previous state\nE, N, vE, vN] --> F[Prediction step]
    B --> F
    F --> G{GPS usable?}
    G -->|Yes| D
    G -->|No| H[Continue local propagation]
    D --> I[Corrected track]
    H --> I
    I --> J[FIT record + UI]
